type: software
title: "Vaca Resonance Analysis (VRA)"
abstract: "Phase-coherent spectral framework for detecting multiplicative order in modular arithmetic sequences. Validated through 27 experiments (E1-E27) with 21/21 passing. Discovers universal e^(-2) coherence limit at phase variance Vφ = 4 rad². Achieves +3.0 dB/doubling M-scaling (power SNR ∝ M) and +5.87 dB/doubling L-scaling (98% efficient). Professional-grade SNR: 36-58 dB. Hardware validated on IBM Brisbane 127-qubit processor (7/7 tests passed). Outperforms RPT by +36.1% precision with 180× speedup."
